# Changelog pipeline.
#
# input.json IS tracked: it looks regenerable but is not — collect resolves page
# titles and URLs at HEAD, so a later re-run produces different content and breaks
# the cross-check that keeps a hallucinated PR off a customer-facing page.
#
# prompt.md is not: it is exactly buildPrompt(input.prs, input.window), so tracking
# it stores the same PR data twice at ~80KB a week. Rebuild with
# `yarn changelog:prompt --date <date>`.
.github/changelog-state/batches/*/prompt.md
.github/changelog-state/cache/
